upan (setelah loop keluar)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "65b7e63c5f9c4b1a8a83", "type": "text", "x": 714, "y": 1505.8, "width": 471.9, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["736b96fd4c4449efa0f4"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1575286299, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1428434952, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419172829, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "flushText · web source yang dikutip provider (bila native search)\nparseCitations dari <CITATIONS> → createCitation → verifyCitations\n  (kutipan dicocokkan ke teks sumber yang diekstrak / opini CourtListener)\nwrite citations{final} + response_details{model, reasoning, usage}\nreturn {fullText, events, citations} — emitDone=false: [DONE] dikirim route", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "flushText · web source yang dikutip provider (bila native search)\nparseCitations dari <CITATIONS> → createCitation → verifyCitations\n  (kutipan dicocokkan ke teks sumber yang diekstrak / opini CourtListener)\nwrite citations{final} + response_details{model, reasoning, usage}\nreturn {fullText, events, citations} — emitDone=false: [DONE] dikirim route", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "4641d45b37bf48ed87cb", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 810, "width": 560, "height": 269.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["d8c44c17b7db4f2e9550"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1828834494, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 299672655, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "c201a5b6cb4f4416ade5", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419172829, "link": null, "locked"